184
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:48,260
Greed doesn't take holidays. Greed doesn't forget. Greed doesn't lose interest when a new television show comes on.

185
00:19:48,420 --> 00:19:53,120
Greed is the only human motivation that has never once failed to show up.

186
00:19:53,740 --> 00:19:58,510
